{"result":{"results":[{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nebius/token-factory-cookbook/main/models/nemotron/README.md","final_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nebius/token-factory-cookbook/main/models/nemotron/README.md","title":null,"description":null,"language":null,"text":"# NVIDIA Nemotron Models\nBrowse NVIDIA Nemotron models available on [Nebius Token Factory](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/models).\n---\n## Available Nemotron Models\n| Model | Provider | Parameters | Context | Highlights |\n|-------|----------|------------|---------|------------|\n| [Nemotron-3.5-Lightning](run\\_nemotron.ipynb)  \n  \n[▶ Try it @ TF](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/playground?models=nvidia/Nemotron-3\\_5-Lightning) | NVIDIA | 30B total   \n 3B active | 1 M | Fast, low-cost MoE model built as the execution layer for always-on, long-running agents and high-throughput specialized tasks |\n| [Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B](nemotron3-super-120B.md)  \n  \n[▶ Try it @ TF](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/playground?models=nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b) | NVIDIA | 120B total   \n 12B active | 256 K | hybrid MoE model optimized for efficient multi-agent AI and complex reasoning tasks. |\n| [Nemotron-3-Ultra-550B-A55B](nemotron3-ultra-550b-a55b.md)  \n  \n[▶ Try it @ TF](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/playground?models=nvidia/Nemotron-3-Ultra-550b-a55b) | NVIDIA | 550B total   \n 55B active | 1 M | Flagship hybrid MoE model optimized for the most demanding multi-agent AI and complex reasoning tasks |\n---\n## Running the Notebooks\nThis directory is a [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) project. From the repo root:\n```bash\ncd models/nemotron\nuv sync\n```\nCreate a `.env` file with your Nebius API key (get one at [tokenfactory.nebius.com](https://tokenfactory.nebius.com/)):\n```bash\ncp env.example .env\n# then edit .env and paste your key\n```\nStart Jupyter and open a notebook:\n```bash\nuv run jupyter lab run\\_nemotron.ipynb\n```\n| Notebook | Model | Runs on |\n|-